#: Game.Levels.Intermediate.L01_First
msgid "## Summary:\n"
"\n"
"§0 will turn a goal §1 into a hypothesis §2\n"
"and goal §3. If §4 and §5 are sets §6 means 'let §7 be an arbitrary element of §8'.\n"
"If §9 and §10 are propositions then §11 says 'assume §12 is true'.\n"
"\n"
"## Details\n"
"\n"
"If your goal is a function or an implication §13 then §14\n"
"will always make progress. §15 turns\n"
"\n"
"§16\n"
"\n"
"into\n"
"\n"
"§17\n"
"\n"
"The opposite tactic to intro is §18; given the situation\n"
"just above, §19 turns the goal back into §20.\n"
"\n"
"## Example\n"
"\n"
"If your goal is an implication §21 then Lean writes\n"
"this as §22, and §23 can be thought of as meaning\n"
"'let §24 be a proof of §25', or more informally 'let's assume that\n"
"§26 is true'. The goal changes to §27 and the hypothesis §28\n"
"appears in the local context."
msgstr ""

