#: Game.Levels.Intermediate.L04_Four
msgid "## Summary\n"
"\n"
"The §0 tactic is a high-level tactic which tries\n"
"to prove equalities using facts in its database.\n"
"\n"
"## Details\n"
"\n"
"The §1 tactic does basic automation.\n"
"For example, some proofs involve a tedious number of rewrites of §2 and §3,\n"
"the same is true of §4 and §5 in the case of multiplication.\n"
"We can use §6 to do this automatically.\n"
"To tell §7 to use some lemma §8 when simplifying, write §9. More generally,\n"
"for §10 to include additional lemmas §11, §12, ..., §13 when simplifying, write\n"
"§14.\n"
"\n"
"### Example:\n"
"If our goal is this:\n"
"§15\n"
"\n"
"we can solve this with §16 using §17."
msgstr ""

